# Home gauge design (LVGL + web)

The touchscreen home gauge and the web Coolroom Status gauge must stay **visually
aligned**. Change one → update the other in the same change.

## Canonical look (as of 2026-08-01)

- **Three concentric arcs only**, drawn on flat `col_bg` (`#1C1C1E`). No frosted
  underlay plate, no outer rim arc, no centre-disc border, no tick marks, no
  CURRENT/SET/AMB ring labels.
- **Colours match the sensor text**: coolroom outer = `col_blue` `#0A84FF`,
  setpoint middle = `col_cyan` `#00BCD4`, ambient inner = `col_pink` `#FF1493`.
  Dim track + bright fill (same hue at lower opacity). The coolroom *value arc*
  stays blue; only the centre temperature *label* recolors (green / blue / red
  for normal / low / high).
- **Dial range** is substitutions `dial_min_c` / `dial_max_c` in
  `esp32-p4-coolroom.yaml` (currently **−10 … +30 °C**). Bottom-left end of the
  horseshoe = dial floor. Setpoint number `min_value` is locked to `dial_min_c`.
  Web `tempToPercent` must use the same floor/ceiling.
- **Geometry**: LVGL stack **440 / 396 / 352**, `arc_width` 14 (~8 px daylight),
  horseshoe **150° → 30°** (240° sweep, gap at 6 o’clock). Web SVG should keep
  the same sweep and proportional radii / equal stroke widths.
- **Centre**: opaque `col_bg` disc (masks ambient ring stub) with no border; big
  readout (`font_huge` 80 / web ~68px), cyan setpoint (`font_large` / ~20px),
  status (`font_medium` / ~15px).
- **Web gauge size**: wrap `min(420px, 88vw)`; SVG radii **140 / 120 / 100**,
  stroke 12 (same sweep as LVGL). No bottom guest login banner — header **🔐 Login**
  unlocks settings.

## Hard rule — do not reintroduce translucent chrome

Anything semi-opaque over `#1C1C1E` composites to **flat grey**, not frost:

| Tried | Composite |
|-------|-----------|
| `#FFFFFF` @ ~22% | ~`#4E4E4E` |
| `col_panel` `#2C2C2E` @ 42% | ~`#232325` |

Do **not** add rim arcs, frosted plates, or faint white borders “for glass”. Rings
on flat background is the approved look.

## Where to edit

| Surface | File |
|---------|------|
| LVGL | `esp32-p4-coolroom.yaml` (home page arcs + `dial_*` substitutions) |
| Scale helpers | `p4_ui.h` (`p4_ui_temp_to_arc_pct` / `p4_ui_setpoint_to_arc_pct`) |
| Web | `assets/dashboard.html` (and `assets/dashboard_virtual_preview.html`) |
| User-facing copy | `reference/USER_MANUAL.md` home-screen gauge section |

After HTML edits: `python3 scripts/embed_dashboard.py` before compile/flash.
